# Burrow Pro: only pro/server and pro/ui enter the build (pro/LICENSE too); never its git data, e2e, evals or scripts.
# pro/ itself must NOT be excluded here (docs/adr/0001-open-core-split.md R4; proBoundary.test.js checks it).
pro/.git
pro/e2e
pro/evals
pro/scripts
pro/node_modules
# Mirrors the sensitive entries of .gitignore. Globs use **/ because .dockerignore has no implicit recursion.
**/.personal-denylist
**/secrets.key
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
**/*.xlsx
**/.npmrc
**/*.local
**/logs
**/*.log
**/*.private.pem
**/*.burrowlicense
**/license-clock.json
**/license-trial.json
**/license-activation.json
